+    date: '1961-01-07'
+    thread: china-leadership
+    c: 'The Center 中共中央 forwards to the regional bureaus and the provincial committees the Ministry of Light Industry Party group''s 轻工业部党组 report of Dec. 30, 1960, "On the urgent arrangement of the production of daily-use industrial goods (chiefly small goods)" 《关于紧急安排日用工业品（主要是小商品）生产的报告》. Its comment: in many places salt, matches, pots, basins, bowls and chopsticks cannot be bought; the shortage comes mainly from the leadership''s failure to arrange, not from the bad harvests. The report: small goods to be written into the state and local plans, their materials supplied, their factories fixed. Sent down to the county and regiment level.'
+    n: '[[w.jianguo-yilai-zhongyao-wenxian]], XIV, 11–18 (the Center''s comment, Jan. 7, 1961, and the report, Dec. 30, 1960; printed from the Central Committee''s document). Made public: 1997. See [[cal.1960-12-30.china-leadership-9]].'
