+    c: 'Nie Rongzhen 聂荣臻 reports to Li Fuchun 李富春, Deng Xiaoping 邓小平 and the Secretariat 中央书记处, "On the arrangement of science and technology work in 1961 and 1962" 《关于一九六一、一九六二年科学技术工作安排的报告》, with his outline: the year''s investment, funds and materials for science to go into each department''s and region''s plan by its line of subordination, the State Science Commission 国家科委 holding no goods or money; little or no building for science in 1961.'
