l-South, the Southwest and the Northwest, each to build a fairly complete economic system for its region; sent to the provincial and municipal committees'' secretariats and the central departments'' Party groups). Made public: 1996. Check: MacFarquhar has Li Fuchun give his opinions on the first day. Check: Yang Shangkun''s diary has the plenum open at 4 p.m. Jan. 14 ([[w.yang-shangkun-riji]], I, 643); a time field. To check: [[w.bank-china]], 71 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 13 n.18a); [[w.mao-zedong-sixiang-wan]], 258–59, 265–66 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.36a); [[w.xuexi-lishi-jueyi-zhuanji]], 121 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.36b); [[w.selections-from-china-mainland]], No. 633, 18 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.37b); [[w.dangshi-yanjiu]], 21–33 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.37d); [[w.xiaozu-huainian-zhou-enlai]], 38 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.37e); [[w.dangdai-zhongguo-jingji]], 353–61 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.37f); [[w.peking-review]], No. 4, 1961, 7 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.40a); [[w.history-of-the-chinese]], 286 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.40b); [[w.renqiong-song-renqiong-huiyilu]], 361–62 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.40c); [[w.schurmann-ideology-and-organization-in]], 147–49 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.40d); [[w.teiwes-politics-at-maos-court]], passim (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 16 n.40e); [[w.zhonggong-dangshi-jiaoxue-cankao]], 23, 434–45 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 17 n.45); [[w.zhongguo-nongye-nianjian-1980]], 34–35 (cited by [[w.macfarquhar-origins-of-the-cultural]], III, 17 n.49c); [[w.lardy-chen-yuns-strategy-for]], 174 (ci