@@ -4974,7 +5057,7 @@ entries:
     date: '1961-05-16'
     thread: china-leadership
     c: 'Chen Yun 陈云 drafts the Center''s Fertilizer Small Group''s 中央化肥小组 report to the Center 中共中央 on the Hangzhou 杭州 forum: of the small works begun in 1959, by the end of 1960 over twenty of 800 tons a year working, five of them steadily, and seven of 2,000 tons, three steadily: not technically proven; the six big works of 25,000 or 50,000 tons running normally, their plant all but proven at home, three sets to be made by the year''s end; ammonium nitrate the main product for two or three years; four or five works of 50,000 tons a year finished in each of 1962–64, 200,000 to 250,000 tons of new capacity a year from 1963, not at other sectors'' cost, first in the cash-crop and high-yield grain areas; 10,000 tons of key metals a works to be imported, 3.2 million dollars, the price of 45,000 tons of grain, against 500,000 to 600,000 tons more grain a year from the fertilizer; plant made at fixed works and supplied in full sets, coal washing, coking, power and transport included; about 30,000 tons of metals a works, over 20,000 of them from home. It goes on the 17th to Mao Zedong 毛泽东, Zhu De 朱德 and Deng Xiaoping 邓小平.'
