@@ -7514,6 +7654,24 @@ entries:
     c: 'Peking 北京. Chen Yun 陈云 speaks to the East China and Northeast groups 华东、东北组 of the Central Work Conference 中共中央工作会议: investigation must go down to the grass roots, and also hear contrary views among the cadres around one, since refuting error is how truth grows, and Mao Zedong Thought 毛泽东思想 grew by struggle with error; compensation to the peasants, 15 to 20 billion yuan in all, 2 billion a year (1.5 from the Center 中央, 0.5 from the localities), to be paid in full, even 40 billion, as a matter of restoring political faith; coal, iron, timber and bamboo for it to be in the plan; the mountain people carrying public and procurement grain out to be paid for the transport.'
