@@ -4932,6 +5018,25 @@ entries:
     c: 'Chen Yun 陈云 presides over the Central Small Group on Industry Supporting Agriculture 中共中央工业支援农业小组 (set up in June under the Secretariat 书记处, Liao Luyan 廖鲁言, Minister of Agriculture, its head) and speaks: next year''s farm-machinery industry to put its material and capacity chiefly into spare parts for repairs, new machines only with what is left; support to differ by district and look decades, even a century, ahead; to feed so many, reclaim land and raise yields, improve fields and seed, and look to the hills and the sea; afforestation a hundred-year task; good seed and chemical fertilizer, as in America, studied and planned by the central organs now that blind command is barred. The group hears Li Yu 黎玉, vice-minister of farm machinery, and asks the Ministries of Forestry 林业部, Aquatic Products 水产部 and Agriculture 农业部 to study the hills, the sea, the fields and the seed.'
