-    c: 'As Hebei 河北 reports have it: in the war scare some at Handan 邯郸 wonder at the fuss over a few shots; others panic, some fleeing to the countryside, some selling all they own for a last feast; villagers elsewhere slaughter their pigs against another requisition; panic buying of batteries and candles; counter-revolutionary slogans foretelling the Party''s fall; in one county an underground group calls on the people to "co-ordinate our movements with the United States and the Soviet Union in our attack on Beijing!"; flares go up; Feng Guiyuan: "When troops from the Soviet Union come, I will go out there and welcome them"; in Wanquan county Ma Yue, a landlord''s wife, takes her children to see the house taken from them in the land reform.'
